<title>USA: Alliance Bancorp Q1 net rises, shr falls.</title>
<headline>Alliance Bancorp Q1 net rises, shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>HINSDALE, Ill 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.32		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			  1,429		    1,201</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 4,483		    2,793</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Alliance Bancorp, formerly Hinsdale Financial Corp, said net income for the first quarter of 1997 was reduced by non-recurring expenses of $343,000, net of tax, including severance incurred in staff restructuring completed with February 10 merger with Liberty Bancorp.</p>
<p>In the merger Alliance exchanged 2,620,270 shares of common stock for all 2,488,675 shares of Liberty Bancorp.</p>
